ement Scales\">Measurement Scales</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-structures-and-formats\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><span>08</span><span data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-sources-and-collection\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><span>09</span><span data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"population-sample-parameter-and-statistic\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><span>10</span><span data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"sampling-methods\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><span>11</span><span data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"bias-confounding-and-error\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><span>12</span><span data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-quality-dimensions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link current\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 16 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 16 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 16 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Frequency table raw value-কে count ও proportion-এ রূপ দেয়। Categorical ও grouped numerical table, cumulative frequency এবং responsible summary শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Frequency tables turn raw values into counts and proportions. Learn categorical and grouped numerical tables, cumulative frequency, and responsible summaries.\">Frequency tables turn raw values into counts and proportions. Learn categorical and grouped numerical tables, cumulative frequency, and responsible summaries.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 45 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Frequency ও relative-frequency table তৈরি করুন।\" data-en=\"Create frequency and relative-frequency tables.\">Create frequency and relative-frequency tables.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Numerical value-কে defensible interval-এ group করুন।\" data-en=\"Group numerical values into defensible intervals.\">Group numerical values into defensible intervals.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Cumulative frequency interpret করুন।\" data-en=\"Interpret cumulative frequency.\">Interpret cumulative frequency.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Misleading bin ও denominator এড়ান।\" data-en=\"Avoid misleading bins and denominators.\">Avoid misleading bins and denominators.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Count ও proportion\" data-en=\"Counts and proportions\">Counts and proportions</h2><p data-bn=\"Frequency table প্রতিটি category বা interval ও count list করে। Relative frequency count-কে relevant total দিয়ে divide করে, different size group compare সহজ হয়। Denominator ও missing-value treatment state করুন।\" data-en=\"A frequency table lists each category or interval and its count. Relative frequency divides each count by the relevant total, making groups with different sizes easier to compare. Always state the denominator and treatment of missing values.\">A frequency table lists each category or interval and its count. Relative frequency divides each count by the relevant total, making groups with different sizes easier to compare. Always state the denominator and treatment of missing values.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Grouped numerical data\" data-en=\"Grouped numerical data\">Grouped numerical data</h2><p data-bn=\"Continuous বা wide-range numerical value interval-এ group করা যায়। Bin mutually exclusive, intended range cover এবং question-এর জন্য meaningful হতে হবে। Cut point change visual story বদলাতে পারে, তাই raw value inspect ও bin justify করুন।\" data-en=\"Continuous or wide-ranging numerical values can be grouped into intervals. Bins should be mutually exclusive, collectively cover the intended range, and be meaningful for the question. Different cut points can change the visual story, so inspect raw values and justify bins.\">Continuous or wide-ranging numerical values can be grouped into intervals. Bins should be mutually exclusive, collectively cover the intended range, and be meaningful for the question. Different cut points can change the visual story, so inspect raw values and justify bins.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Cumulative frequency\" data-en=\"Cumulative frequency\">Cumulative frequency</h2><p data-bn=\"Cumulative frequency category বা upper boundary পর্যন্ত count add করে। এটি “কত order তিন দিনের মধ্যে delivered?” প্রশ্নের answer দেয়। Ordered category বা numerical interval প্রয়োজন।\" data-en=\"Cumulative frequency adds counts up to a category or upper boundary. It answers questions such as “How many orders were delivered within three days?” It requires ordered categories or numerical intervals.\">Cumulative frequency adds counts up to a category or upper boundary. It answers questions such as “How many orders were delivered within three days?” It requires ordered categories or numerical intervals.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-4\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">04</div><h2 data-bn=\"Summary view একটি choice\" data-en=\"Summary views are choices\">Summary views are choices</h2><p data-bn=\"Frequency table detail reduce করে distribution reveal করে। Rare value, subgroup difference বা time pattern hide করতে পারে। Raw-data check, missingness count ও suitable chart-এর সঙ্গে ব্যবহার করুন।\" data-en=\"A frequency table reduces detail to reveal distribution. It can also hide rare values, subgroup differences, or time patterns. Use it with raw-data checks, missingness counts, and suitable charts.\">A frequency table reduces detail to reveal distribution. It can also hide rare values, subgroup differences, or time patterns. Use it with raw-data checks, missingness counts, and suitable charts.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Frequency\" data-en=\"Frequency\">Frequency</h3><p data-bn=\"Category বা interval-এর observation count।\" data-en=\"The count of observations in a category or interval.\">The count of observations in a category or interval.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Relative frequency\" data-en=\"Relative frequency\">Relative frequency</h3><p data-bn=\"Frequency relevant total দিয়ে divided।\" data-en=\"Frequency divided by the relevant total.\">Frequency divided by the relevant total.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Cumulative frequency\" data-en=\"Cumulative frequency\">Cumulative frequency</h3><p data-bn=\"Ordered frequency-এর running total।\" data-en=\"Running total of ordered frequencies.\">Running total of ordered frequencies.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Bin\" data-en=\"Bin\">Bin</h3><p data-bn=\"Numerical value group করার interval।\" data-en=\"An interval used to group numerical values.\">An interval used to group numerical values.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Order value distribution\" data-en=\"Order value distribution\">Order value distribution</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"Order value: 450, 620, 780, 820, 1,050, 1,200, 1,450, 1,900, 2,400, 5,500।\" data-en=\"Order values: 450, 620, 780, 820, 1,050, 1,200, 1,450, 1,900, 2,400, 5,500.\">Order values: 450, 620, 780, 820, 1,050, 1,200, 1,450, 1,900, 2,400, 5,500.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"Business use অনুযায়ী interval: 1,000-এর নিচে; 1,000–1,999; 2,000–2,999; 3,000 বা বেশি।\" data-en=\"Choose intervals related to business use: below 1,000; 1,000–1,999; 2,000–2,999; 3,000 or more.\">Choose intervals related to business use: below 1,000; 1,000–1,999; 2,000–2,999; 3,000 or more.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"প্রতিটি interval-এর order count করুন।\" data-en=\"Count orders in each interval.\">Count orders in each interval.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"Relative frequency-এর জন্য 10 দিয়ে divide করুন।\" data-en=\"Divide by 10 for relative frequencies.\">Divide by 10 for relative frequencies.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Last bin high-value order ধারণ করে কিন্তু exact magnitude hide করে।\" data-en=\"Notice that the last bin contains a high-value order but hides its exact magnitude.\">Notice that the last bin contains a high-value order but hides its exact magnitude.</p></li><li><span>5</span><p data-bn=\"Grouped table-এর সঙ্গে raw maximum inspect করুন।\" data-en=\"Inspect the raw maximum alongside the grouped table.\">Inspect the raw maximum alongside the grouped table.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Table distribution compactly communicate করে, কিন্তু unusual value examination replace করে না।\" data-en=\"The table communicates distribution compactly, but it should not replace examination of unusual values.\">The table communicates distribution compactly, but it should not replace examination of unusual values.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Frequency একটি count।\" data-en=\"Frequency is a count.\">Frequency is a count.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Relative frequency stated denominator ব্যবহার করে।\" data-en=\"Relative frequency uses a stated denominator.\">Relative frequency uses a stated denominator.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Bin grouped numerical summary shape করে।\" data-en=\"Bins shape grouped numerical summaries.\">Bins shape grouped numerical summaries.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Grouped view important detail hide করতে পারে।\" data-en=\"Grouped views can hide important detail.\">Grouped views can hide important detail.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/introductory-statistics-2e/pages/1-3-frequency-frequency-tables-and-levels-of-measurement\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OpenStax — Frequency Tables and Levels of Measurement ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/eda_d.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIST/SEMATECH — Exploratory Data Analysis ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}